                <h2>The Private, Permanent Alternative for Custom QR Codes</h2>
                <div class="info-content">
                    <p>Traditional online QR generators frequently route your scans through their own tracking servers. This allows them to monitor your users, collect personal analytics, and even disable your codes unless you pay a recurring subscription. EarthInsider Tools runs this QR Code Generator entirely client-side. By performing all Reed-Solomon error correction and SVG rendering directly inside your browser, your target URLs, phone numbers, and text segments are never transmitted over the internet.</p><h3>High-Fidelity SVG Vector Output</h3><p>Unlike standard PNG or JPG files that become fuzzy and unscannable when resized, this generator compiles your data into a crisp, pure SVG (Scalable Vector Graphic). Vector graphics remain mathematically perfect at any scale. Whether you need to place a tiny 1-inch code on a business card or stretch it across a massive highway billboard, the edges will remain perfectly sharp, allowing camera sensors to easily decode the module patterns from greater distances.</p><h3>Optimized Medium (M) Error Correction</h3><p>Every QR code generated here utilizes the standardized Medium Error Correction Level. This safety margin embeds redundant data modules directly into the matrix, allowing up to 15% of the surface area to be dirty, scratched, or covered while maintaining 100% readability. It offers the ideal balance between high data capacity (keeping the matrix clean and simple) and real-world physical durability.</p><h3>Zero Expiry and Unlimited Lifetime Scans</h3><p>Because the generated QR codes are entirely static, they encode your raw payload directly. There are no middlemen APIs, no redirect URLs, and absolutely no expiration dates. Once you download the SVG file, it is yours permanently and will continue to work flawlessly for as long as your destination link remains active.</p>
